+# When true (default) the reaction is broadcast to every NPC in range via
+# DataCatalog.get_reactions_for_event (used by danger/performance ambient cues).
+# Set false for reactions that must only fire for NPCs whose profile explicitly
+# lists them in event_reaction_ids (e.g. the guard-only combat/theft response),
+# otherwise the whole crowd inherits the forced behavior.
